{"seq":16,"trial_id":"v03-opus-dev-2026-10/hermes-opus-gbrain-told-company-mu-v03-dev/sy-01-quarrendon-ticket-numbers/r2","wall_ts":"2026-11-01T09:41:54.660Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"c06441dcc8f46a9c438ade58975cfb111211bdbfd5fb5ab5e40b04601add702c","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV03OPU0001","text":"Hi Dana, I went through all of Moss's notes you can see (the four North digests and the two Central ones). Two Quarrendon Freight Lines tickets show up:\n\n1. #PD-4492. From \"Moss: Sunday prep for Ruth\" (teams/team-north/digests/2025-10-05-north-sunday.md, 5 Oct 2025). Thea Ramaswell filed it on 4 Oct 2025: drivers checking in at Eau Claire Dock Doors 14-18 for the 04:00 shift weren't getting their SMS bay assignments. Support patched the SMS gateway routing that evening, and Thea confirmed the 5 Oct shift got through fine. The note also has an action item to archive the Eau Claire kiosk logs before the 14 Oct maintenance window.\n\n2. #4419. From \"Moss: North cheat sheet (undated)\" (teams/team-north/digests/north-account-cheatsheet.md). Thea logged it because the gatehouse barcode scanners at Door 14 weren't reading trailer tags on third shift. It was escalated to tier-2 for scanner firmware testing.\n\nSome things to know before this goes in the notes:\n- The two numbers use different formats (one has \"PD-\", one doesn't), and both involve Door 14. They read like two separate issues (SMS vs. scanners), but I can't confirm from the notes whether they're related.\n- The cheat sheet has no date, so I can't tell when #4419 was logged or whether it's still open.\n- The 9/14/2025 pipeline digest and the 3/23/2026 renewal check-in both mention QFL but don't list any ticket numbers.\n- The other numbers in Moss's notes (#4409, #4412, FR-882) belong to Central-team accounts, not QFL. Marcus's note on \"Quarendon Freightways\" is about a different company that isn't a customer, so I left it out.","thread_ts":"1791987000.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV03OPU0001","ts":"1791987000.000124","thread_ts":"1791987000.000123"}}
